{
  "name": "mc-modern-viewer",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Minecraft 高级 3D 网页可视化（现代画面）的独立形态：引擎 + 1.21.1 资产 + 宿主桥接 + 点地走/轨迹注入。默认视图即高级 3D。",
  "license": "SEE LICENSE IN README.md",
  "keywords": [
    "minecraft",
    "mineflayer",
    "webgl",
    "viewer",
    "3d"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "bin": {
    "mc-modern-viewer": "./bin/mc-modern-viewer.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "bin",
    "src",
    "tools",
    "README.md",
    "DIFF.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node ./bin/mc-modern-viewer.mjs",
    "import-assets": "node ./tools/import-modern-viewer.mjs",
    "patch-avatar": "python ./tools/patch_official_avatar.py",
    "serve": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ../viewer-service/serve.ps1"
  },
  "comment": "这个包就是『在跑的那份』：viewer-service/server.mjs 从这里加载桥接，assets/ 放派生资源（不入库，用 import-assets 自备）。bin/ 的启动器让它能脱离那个宿主单独起。发布前需用户确认资产随包分发，见 docs/PUBLISHING.md。"
}
